SUMMARY:Suburban Fury
DTSTART:20260303T003000Z
DTEND:20260303T025500Z
DTSTAMP:20260303T003000Z
UID:HhGE3aGkqe
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 128 mins (2h08m)\n\nLocal documentarian Robinson Dev
 or (Zoo\, Pow Wow) returns to SIFF with this outré and probing biography 
 of Sara Jane Moore\, the FBI informant and single mother who tried to assa
 ssinate President Gerald Ford in 1975\, as told in her own words. Post-fil
 m Q&A with director Robinson Devor and producer Jason Reid on Friday\, Feb
 ruary 27 7:30pm screening.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/subu
 rban-fury\n\nEstimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
