 ssinate President Gerald Ford in 1975\, as told in her own words. Post-fil
 m Q&A with director Robinson Devor and producer Jason Reid on Friday\, Feb
 ruary 27 7:30pm screening.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/subu
 rban-fury\n\nEstimated start: 16:45
