 s a talented teen\, hoping to give her what he never had. But their bond 
 — rooted in good intentions — spirals into a web of poor decisions and
  the weight of unmet ambitions.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters
 /a-poet\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
